    "C"
  ],
  "solution": {
    "text": "<blockquote><p>Let <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>a</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>g</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mfrac><mrow><mn>3</mn><msub><mi>z</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn><msub><mi>z</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow></mfrac></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mi>&#952;</mi><mo>,</mo></math>&nbsp;and we know that, if the&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>a</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>g</mi><mfenced><mi>z</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mi>&#945;</mi><mo>,</mo></math>&nbsp;then&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>a</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>g</mi><mfenced><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mi>z</mi></mfrac></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mi>&#945;</mi><mo>.</mo></math><br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8756;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>a</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>g</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><msub><mi>z</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn><msub><mi>z</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mrow></mfrac></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mi>&#952;</mi></math></p><p>Also, we know that a complex number&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>w</mi></math>&nbsp;can be expressed as&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>w</mi><mo>=</mo><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mi>w</mi></mfenced><mfenced><mrow><mi>cos</mi><mi>&#945;</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>i</mi><mi>sin</mi><mi>&#945;</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>,</mo></math>&nbsp;where&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>&#945;</mi></math>&nbsp;is the argument of the complex number.</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8756;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>z</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>3</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\" separators=\"|\"><mfrac><msub><mi>z</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><msub><mi>z</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mfrac></mfenced><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>cos</mi><mi>&#952;</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>i</mi><mi>sin</mi><mi>&#952;</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mn>2</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\" separators=\"|\"><mfrac><msub><mi>z</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><msub><mi>z</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mfrac></mfenced><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>cos</mi><mi>&#952;</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>i</mi><mi>sin</mi><mi>&#952;</mi></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p>Given,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>3</mn><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><msub><mi>z</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><msub><mi>z</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mfenced><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#8658;</mo><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mfrac><msub><mi>z</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><msub><mi>z</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mfrac></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>4</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac><mo>,</mo></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>z</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>3</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>&#215;</mo><mfrac><mn>4</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>cos</mi><mi>&#952;</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>i</mi><mi>sin</mi><mi>&#952;</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mn>2</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac><mo>&#215;</mo><mfrac><mn>3</mn><mn>4</mn></mfrac><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>cos</mi><mi>&#952;</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>i</mi><mi>sin</mi><mi>&#952;</mi></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>z</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>cos</mi><mi>&#952;</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>i</mi><mi>sin</mi><mi>&#952;</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>cos</mi><mi>&#952;</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>i</mi><mi>sin</mi><mi>&#952;</mi></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>z</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>5</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mi>cos</mi><mi>&#952;</mi><mo>+</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mfrac><mn>3</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mi>sin</mi><mi>&#952;</mi></mrow></mfenced><mi>i</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8756;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\" separators=\"|\"><mi>z</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mfrac><mn>25</mn><mn>4</mn></mfrac><msup><mi>cos</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mi>&#952;</mi><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mn>9</mn><mn>4</mn></mfrac><msup><mi>sin</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mi>&#952;</mi></msqrt></math></p><p>Now, using&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>sin</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mi>&#952;</mi><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>cos</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mi>&#952;</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo></math>&nbsp;we get</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\" separators=\"|\"><mi>z</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mfrac><mn>25</mn><mn>4</mn></mfrac><msup><mi>cos</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mi>&#952;</mi><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mn>9</mn><mn>4</mn></mfrac><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><msup><mi>cos</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mi>&#952;</mi></mrow></mfenced></msqrt></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mi>z</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mn>4</mn><msup><mi>cos</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mi>&#952;</mi><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mn>9</mn><mn>4</mn></mfrac></msqrt></math></p><p>And, we know that the maximum value of&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>cos</mi><mi>&#952;</mi></math>&nbsp;is&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>1</mn><mo>.</mo></math><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8756;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><msub><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\" separators=\"|\"><mi>z</mi></mfenced><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mn>4</mn><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mn>9</mn><mn>4</mn></mfrac></msqrt><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>5</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>.</mo></math></p></blockquote>"
  }
}